            "text": "<p>When you buy from Oceans Optics, you are not just getting an ultra cool Ocean Tee, you are helping us build real living coral reefs.</p><p>A portion of every sale goes towards our artificial reef project in Koh Tao, Thailand. We worked with Global Reef and the Thai Department of Marine & Coastal Resources to sink a custom steel structure shaped like a prescription scuba mask. Onto this frame we attach living coral fragments that grow over time, attracting fish and turning the structure into a living reef and safe haven for marine life.</p><p>So each time you wear your Tee, you can be proud knowing you are also actively helping save the ocean we all love. Thank you!</p>",
